Word list data in this folder
=============================

The files in data/ (including data/raw/ and the derived data/words.*.json files)
are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The application source code is licensed separately under MIT (see ../LICENSE).

Attribution
-----------

New General Service List (NGSL) 1.2
  Browne, C., Culligan, B., and Phillips, J. (2013). The New General Service List.
  https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/
  Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

New Academic Word List (NAWL) 1.2
  Browne, C., Culligan, B., and Phillips, J. (2013). The New Academic Word List.
  https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/new-academic-word-list
  Licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Changes
-------

- data/raw/ngsl.csv and data/raw/nawl.csv are the official "stats" files of the
  lists, renamed (the byte order mark of nawl.csv was removed). Content unchanged.
- data/words.ngsl.json adds Turkish meanings, English alternatives, short English
  definitions, example sentences with Turkish translations, part of speech and an
  estimated CEFR level to each NGSL lemma. These additions were generated with
  Google Gemini and may be edited by hand. They are shared under the same
  CC BY-SA 4.0 license.
